WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.940
A huge old house is on fire.

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:05.650
It has only one narrow door.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.130
Inside, his children
are lost in their games.

4
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.780
They do not know what fire
is, and ignore his calls.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:16.130
He shouts: what you
wanted, drawn by goats,

6
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.160
deer and oxen, is
waiting outside the gate!

7
00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:25.640
The story is from the Lotus Sutra, a
Mahayana text loved across East Asia.

8
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:28.960
So if a father lies to save his children,

9
00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.620
has he done wrong?

10
00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:35.890
In this mission, you'll decode the
parable and meet upaya: skilful means.

11
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.340
Then you'll put the
father's choice to the test,

12
00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:40.730
just as the sutra itself does.

13
00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:44.200
Your mission: find out whether
the father has done wrong.
